msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:43
msgid "Number of days the challenge cookie remains valid."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:55
msgid "Bind the cookie to the ip"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:56
msgid ""
"Add the ip to the signature, so a cookie shared with another machine is "
"refused. Only for a controlled network: an ip changes without the visitor "
"moving (ipv6 rotation, dual stack, private relay, vpn) and is shared by many "
"visitors behind a nat. Toggling it invalidates all cookies."
msgstr ""

