#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:106
msgid "Exempted search engines"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:107
msgid ""
"Search engines whose published ip ranges are excluded from the challenge. "
"Without exemption, they receive the javascript challenge, do not solve it, "
"and stop indexing the site. The ranges are bundled with the module and may "
"be updated with the job below."
msgstr ""

