"source that is unreachable or truncated is skipped and the bundled ranges "
"are kept."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:129
msgid "Exception IPs"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:130
msgid ""
"Ips v4 or v6 or cidr ranges to exclude from the challenge, one per line: the "
"networks of the institution, a partner harvester, a specific bot. They are "
"added to the ranges of the search engines above."
msgstr ""

